# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug/
target/
# Application lock files (Cargo.lock, package-lock.json, yarn.lock) are
# committed for reproducible builds. Do not ignore Cargo.lock: it also pins
# transitive dependency versions that affect security (e.g.
# soroban-env-host's crypto dependencies).

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

.idea
.vs 
.vscode
node_modules
*.wasm

# Local credentials -- NEVER commit these.
config.local.js
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
secrets*.js
*.pem
*.key
